://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270130/extras/35f7a289da30a8d40732b4eee6859e43.mp4?t=1726695775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As you journey through the depths of Hell, you'll have access to an impressive arsenal of weapons to aid you in your quest. In &quot;First Day in Hell&quot; you'll get a taste of what's to come as you wield weapons like the Machete, Revolver, Pump Action Shotgun, Double Barreled Shotgun with Harpoon, and Assault Rifle AG043. Each weapon has its own unique strengths and weaknesses, allowing you to tailor your approach to each encounter. Whether you prefer to get up close and personal with the Machete or take out enemies from a distance with the powerful AG043, Bloodhound's arsenal has something for every playstyle. So gear up, lock and load, and get ready to take the fight to the cult of Astaroth in this adrenaline-fueled shooter.",
